          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Districts of that (account?):</li>\n<li>Bas\u016b\u1e6d Nah\u012bsah.</li>\n<li>Of which has come in:</li>\n<li>2,208 &oacute; irdabbs.</li>\n<li>Wheat: 1,287 irdabbs&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&frac14; and \u215b,</li>\n<li>barley: 179 irdabbs</li>\n<li>\u2153 and \u215b,</li>\n<li>(and) broad beans 741 irdabbs</li>\n<li>\u2153 and \u215b.</li></ol>\n",
